examples/reject/packages/dimension-torque-scale/main.vast:15:1: E_DIMENSION: the physical metric `dimension_torque_scale::PQ` normalizes `e`, which its reading reads as `vastitas_nature::dimension::Energy`, by the scale `dimension_torque_scale::tau` of `vastitas_nature::dimension::Torque`; `normalized` needs a scale of the coordinate's own quantity, and an equal dimension is not enough
